what is up everybody it's animak here  for  anime uproar and today i will be delving  deep  into the warped world of boku no hero's  current  war arc did deku just put himself  at risk of losing one for all  is shigaraki now a prisoner inside his  own body and how does nana shimura  tie into all of this oh and is bakugo  going to be okay after sustaining a very  serious injury at the hands of shigaraki  let's talk about it but first up this  past  week we reached 1 million subscribers  here on the anime opera channel that  is incredible honestly it doesn't even  feel real  i want to give my most sincere thank you  to each and every one of you who took  the time to subscribe and click that  little notification bell  i can't believe that over a million of  you guys enjoyed our content enough to  do that  and i am very humbled and grateful to  each and every one of you  thank you so much finally of course this  video will contain boku no hero manga  spoilers we're talking about the latest  events in the story  so please proceed with caution you have  been warned  as you will recall the previous  installment of the story  ended with a massive cliffhanger both  endeavour  and bakugou were pierced by shigaraki's  black and red spikes  and both of their injuries looked pretty  serious  if the newest chapter started off with  some kind of flashback or if the focus  had switched to another location  i would have been pissed but thankfully  horikoshi was merciful this time and the  action picks up right where it left  off after being pierced by shigaraki  bakugo is covered in blood  but he still manages to call out to deku  to tell him not to go playing hiro  by himself this might sound like bakugo  is being his usual competitive self  but in reality bakugou is saying this  because he is worried about deku pushing  himself too far  this time it's not competition that's  driving bakugo  it's genuine concern for his friend and  he was willing to sacrifice his own life  to protect  deku honestly that was pretty  heartwarming  bakugou has definitely come a long way  and hopefully he continues to develop as  a character  unless he dies of course meanwhile the  barbecued shigeraki appears to be  fighting  with himself and it seems like he is  saying stop it  to someone it's safe to assume that he's  saying this to all for one  since in the last chapter all for one  straight up to control of shigaraki's  body  officially all for once said that he did  it to help shigaraki survive this fight  but as i mentioned in my previous boku  no hero video  a few of us have been suspicious of all  for one for a very long time  and we believe that he might be trying  to take over shigaraki's body so that he  himself can use it  as his new vessel when deku finally  processes  what just happened to bakugo he  absolutely loses it  thankfully shoto is able to grab bakugou  in midair and fly him away from  shigaraki and presumably to a safer  location  but even though bakugou appears to have  been taken out of harm's way  we still don't know how bad his injuries  were since the spikes  pierced his torso clean through some  vital organs  might have been damaged it did kind of  look like bakugou had blood coming out  of his mouth  which would suggest that one of his  lungs was injured  but we can't know for sure because that  blood around his mouth might have been  splattered from his torso wound  it's possible that he got lucky and the  spike missed all of his vital organs  and that is probably what happened  because i do not think that bakugou is  going to die  i think that horikoshi just wanted to  scare us a bit but  that doesn't mean that other less  important characters are  safe in fact i think quite a few of them  are in serious danger  back inside shigaraki's mind all for one  seems to be winning the fight to control  shigaraki's body  he says that the fight between one for  all and all for one has already shed a  lot of useless blood  but what just happened to bakugo has to  be the most useless of all  when he hears this and when he thinks  about all the other people who suffered  during this fight deku snaps he knows  that keeping his cool and keeping his  head clear is the best way to control  his power  but he just can't help it after bakugo's  brave sacrifice  deku refuses to sit back and listen to  all for one disparaging his friend  deku goes full legendary super saiyan  mode and he rushes at shigaraki slash  all for one as we see a close-up of  shigaki's face it seems clear that all  for one  is the one in control and to make things  even creepier  all for one inside of shigaraki is  actually smirking  and this is the point at which the focus  of the chapter shifts to another  location so yes  it did happen but not at the very  beginning which is good  gigantomachia continues to rampage  through various cities on his way to  jakku  and as he moves he is now beginning to  pick up two different scents  and they somehow both belong to his  master this suggests that  makia is somehow able to detect the fact  that all for one has just taken over  shigaraki's  body that's interesting because i kind  of assumed that all for one had just  taken over shigaraki's consciousness  and of course consciousness doesn't have  its own scent  so theoretically machia shouldn't have  noticed a difference  but there might be something else going  on here after all we still don't know  the specifics of fujiko's procedure but  it is possible that the procedure  included some modifications that even  shigaraki wasn't aware of  and maybe it is one of these  modifications which allows  all for one to not only take over  shigaraki's mind but to also manifest  in physical form i don't know how this  would even work  but this brief moment in which makia  senses over one's presence  inside shigaraki is likely a clue about  an important reveal that will happen  in the coming chapters we should  definitely keep an eye on that  and on machia's reaction back in jakku  the hero students who have been helping  with evacuations are now fully aware of  the dire situation in which they find  themselves in  deku and the other heroes fighting  shigaraki don't even know that makia is  coming because remember shigaraki used  his quirks to jam  all the communication signals and so if  the other hero students don't  act now to help deku and the others and  to inform them about  gigantomachia shigaraki and makia will  join forces  and then the situation will be utterly  hopeless  as ochako wonders how deku bakugou and  shoto are doing  we suddenly switch focus back to the  main battlefield  shoto screams and in the very next panel  we see shigaraki  or i guess all for one within  shigaraki's body placing his hand  directly on deku's face all for once  says  i finally touched you now be mine  one for all suddenly deku or i guess his  consciousness  finds itself inside a strange and barren  place  but deku's body is not complete he looks  like he did  back in that strange vestige world in  chapter 193  except this time around more of his body  is  actually visible in chapter 193 it was  implied that deku's ability to access  and act within the vestige world  depended on the percentage of one for  all that he could actually use  so presumably now that he can use a  higher percentage of one for all  more of his body is visible inside the  vestige  world in the distance deku can see  shigaraki  and all for one shigaraki is doing his  best to resist  all for one and he's telling him to get  out and to not get any closer  but all for one insists that if he  hadn't lent him his power  shigaraki would have been burnt to a  crisp and died  shigaraki continues to resist and he  tells his mentor that he wants to  control his own body and follow his  own path but all for one seems  determined to remain in control of  shigaraki's body  the big question is whether this control  is only temporary  or whether all for one is attempting to  take over for good and maybe that was  his plan  all along the other thing that i'm  wondering is whether this is the real  all for one  or just some vestige or fragment of his  consciousness that was hidden away  inside the all for one quirk factor  maybe it doesn't matter because it  amounts to the same thing  but i'm very curious to know how exactly  all for one was able to orchestrate  this takeover if this really was all  part of his plan  how did he manage to split his  consciousness in a way that allows him  to exist in two places  at the same time inside his original  body in tartarus prison  and also inside shigaraki was this the  work of some sort of consciousness  copying quirk is this just how the all  for one quirk factor works  maybe it carries over vestiges of its  former user just like one for all does  there are so many intriguing questions  about what is happening to shigaraki  right now and if that's not enough deku  is now mixed up in all of this  as well while deku watches the struggle  between shigaraki and all for one unfold  he wants to do something but he can't on  the last page of the chapter we see  nana shimura as she touches the back of  deku's head  and tells him that he still can't move  in this world  but they will do something about that  and that is how this mind-boggling  chapter ends  and we are left with so many unanswered  questions and with so many possibilities  for what could happen next  i couldn't help but notice that nana had  also touched  the back of shigaraki's head in his own  dream world back when he first awoke  from his procedure  and now she touched deku in almost the  same way  but what is the significance of this and  by the way  what is this vestige world anyway is it  a dream world of sorts  is it a vision is it something between a  dream and a vision  is it the manifestation of the  consciousnesses of all of these  different people coming together  there are just so many unknowns i mean  it was one thing back when deku would  enter this world in order to communicate  with previous one for all users  we all just assumed that access to this  vestige world is a unique trait  possessed by a user of one for all  but then why did shigaraki enter a  similar world  back when he first woke up from the  procedure and how was  nana apparently able to enter  shigaraki's dream world  and also deku's vestige world and while  we're on the topic  why do deku shigaraki and all for one  all appear to be inside the same vestige  world  right now this is all very confusing and  mysterious but the main connection  appears to be  the two quirks one for all and all for  one  after all all for one was used to create  one for all in the first place  so perhaps the vestige world is not  unique only to one for all  perhaps the original vestige world stems  from all for one itself  and so now that he has come into direct  contact with all for one  deku is able to share this same world  with shigaraki all for one  nana and who knows who else i am sure  that in the coming chapters nana will  give us more crucial information  but the big question now is what happens  next is deku about to fight  all for one and shigaraki inside this  vested world  instead of in the outside physical world  and if so  how is deku going to fight when most of  his bodies still can't even manifest  inside this world is nana about to teach  deku to unlock  even more of one for all's power which  will theoretically give him full access  to this vested world  we definitely need more information  about the true nature of one for all  and all for one but i admit that i'm  intrigued  by this strange development what do you  guys think  what is this vestige world really and  how are deku and shigaraki able to enter  the same  one together and what does this crazy  development mean  for the rest of the story are we about  to witness an inner battle between one  for all and all for one  or is it going to stay on outward  physical battle or are we gonna get a  little bit of both  this is starting to remind me of the  demon king battle in the seven deadly  sins manga  but we'll wait and see where this thing  goes definitely leave your thoughts  down in the comments below if you  enjoyed this video you want to see more  boku no hero content right here on the  channel  please drop a like to let me know it  really does help  thank you so much for 1 million  subscribers that is crazy  and if you're not one of our subscribers  yet please consider subscribing and  hitting that notification bell to turn  on  all notifications you can also hit me up  on twitter  and instagram at animeopror  i want to give a big thank you to all of  our anime uproar patrons for making  videos like this one  possible a special thank you to alpha  sigma  and liam thompson disciples of lord  twego  himself and i can't forget all of our  the one tier patrons the ones who rise  above  all other clans including ingrata  the world acquired respect pate heffa  jonathan king  rathuyin deora emperor otaku thomas  jones kin mano  admirath and chris torley finally thank  you also to our pro hero tier patrons  including  the one and only gilgamesh nothing but a  fan king zeldris  anatoly kazatsky angel cruz cricket xp  joe stanton very gucci alicia octor  hinokamian water  bonnie parks jason wilson florian joy  and garcia  steelers mcshamus jessica kayla fond  deadly saint  stern hawkings and high school dxd73  if you enjoy our videos and you feel  that they provide value to you  consider becoming a patron even a single  dollar will give you access to our  patron exclusive discord  and your name will appear in our videos  along with these  amazing people as always thank you guys  so much for watching  and until next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

