ened to bakugo has to  be the most useless of all  when he hears this and when he thinks  about all the other people who suffered  during this fight deku snaps he knows  that keeping his cool and keeping his  head clear is the best way to control  his power  but he just can't help it after bakugo's  brave sacrifice  deku refuses to sit back and listen to  all for one disparaging his friend  deku goes full legendary super saiyan  mode and he rushes at shigaraki slash  all for one as we see a close-up of  shigaki's face it seems clear that all  for one  is the one in control and to make things  even creepier  all for one inside of shigaraki is  actually smirking  and this is the point at which the focus  of the chapter shifts to another  location so yes  it did happen but not at the very  beginning which is good  gigantomachia continues to rampage  through various cities on his way to  jakku  and as he moves he is now beginning to  pick up two different scents  and they somehow both belong to his  master this suggests that  makia is somehow able to detect the fact  that all for one has just taken over  shigaraki's  body that's interesting because i kind  of assumed that all for one had just  taken over shigaraki's consciousness  and of course consciousness doesn't have  its own scent  so theoretically machia shouldn't have  noticed a difference  but there might be something else going  on here after all we still don't know  the specifics of fujiko's procedure but  it is possible that the procedure  included some modifications that even  shigaraki wasn't aware of  and maybe it is one of these  modifications which allows  all for one to not only take over  shigaraki's mind but to also manifest  in physical form i don't know how this  would even work  but this brief moment in which makia  senses over one's presence  inside shigaraki is likely a clue about  an important reveal that will happen  in the coming chapters we should  definitely keep an eye on that  and on machi